"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Are pregnant or lactating\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or breastfeeding\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have participated in any other studies involving investigational products\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"within 30 days prior to entry into this study\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Are undergoing an acute withdrawal syndrome from drugs or alcohol\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of substance abuse\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have an Axis I diagnosis of Schizophrenia, Schizoaffective Disorder, Schizophreniform Disorder or Bipolar I Disorder\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"as diagnosed by the Structured Clinical Interview for DSM-IV Axis I Disorders (SCID-I)\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Have an unstable medical disorder as determined by physical examination or laboratory testing\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"or have a